      "source_context": "Fertilization In addition to soil amendments added before planting, shallots should be given a base fertilizer of 1/2 pound of nitrogen fertilizer (21-0-0) per 100 square feet 30 days after planting and again 60 days after planting. Do not fertilize after mid-July as extra nitrogen stimulates late season leaf growth and reduces bulb storage potential.",
